  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「やるなら正々堂々、お互いのエゴを通そうじゃないか！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「少なくとも、学院に入ったばかりの私たちはそれが正しいと思ってきた！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「問題児たちの多い君咲学院で生きていくために、平凡な私たちが必死に身につけた方法じゃないか！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
